  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-financed Water Projects for Irrigation and Consumption to help improve local economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SGG Projecten B.V. pre-finances water projects, both for consumption as well as for irrigation of vegetable gardens in the Gambia. Projects are contracted with our clients: locally organized groups or village communities. SGG surveys, plans, and manages the project until it is finished, as well as water flows. After water starts flowing, the projects turn into a financial service. The local communities then start repaying over the course of several years, causing a sustainable business model and local employment. 6 direct and 6 indirect jobs were provided during the course of this DGGF-TA. Irrigation of vegetable gardens lead to fertile lands where 90 women are producing crops for consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
